    where :math:`x \in \left\{0, \; \cdots , \; \text{x.size}(0) - 1\right\}`, \
    :math:`y \in \left\{0, \; \cdots , \; \text{y.size}(0) - 1\right\}`, \
    :math:`0 \leq y[j] \leq \text{x.size}(0)-1`, \
